【Abstract】 As a type of breast cancer that poses a great challenge to treatment, locally advanced breast cancer (LABC) urgently requires standardized treatment regimens. Currently, the treatment of LABC mainly involves combined therapies of various treatment modalities, including neoadjuvant therapy, surgical treatment, and adjuvant therapy after surgery. In order to improve the treatment effect of LABC, the Breast Special Committee of the Chinese Research Hospital Association and the Expert Group on the Diagnosis and Treatment of Locally Advanced Breast Cancer in Chinese Women, combining the latest research achievements at home and abroad with China's national conditions, have formulated the "Expert Consensus on the Diagnosis and Treatment of Locally Advanced Breast Cancer in Chinese Women (2025 Edition)". The authors of this consensus elaborate
